Z||000000||Huck||02-27-2001||09:33 PM||||I was just listening to my favorite radio station, Edge 102 in Toronto.  They just did a "History of new rock clip" that they often do talking about Marilyn Manson's first car.<P>Apparently his first car was an 84 fiero... they said he was driving home after purchasing a large Cobra snake at a pet store when his Fiero burst into flames.  Manson complained that nobody would pick him up on the freeway since he was standing next to a burning car with a cobra around his neck with his thumb out hitchin a ride...<P>I HATE when the public talks about "The Fiero Fireball" or "The Flaming Fiero" ... it gives the general population a bad image of our pride and joy.  Why aren't other cars ridiculed for engine fires the same as Fiero's?  It was just 3 weeks ago I was driving my friends 87 Sunbird to the bar when at a stop light we had to jump out of the car to try and put out the fire that was under HIS hood!<P>I just get so  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">frusterated <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> sometimes....||||reg||8
